@startuml
!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:Course registration;
:If an exception is needed;
:v1: Is exception needed? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
if () then ([v1 = "Yes"])
:a Request for the exception should be made;
:After the exception is approved;
else ([v1 = "No"])
:the process can continue;
endif
:course enrollment;
:seminar group enrollment;
:the homework assignment can be started;
:working on the homework;
:it should be turned in;
:The homework will then be evaluated;
:v2: Homework evaluation result ({Not last, Last_Accreditation, Last_Announce}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v2 = "Not last"])
:If it was not the last homework;
:another homework assignment will be given;
case ([v2 = "Last_Accreditation"])
:granting accreditation;
repeat :;
:signing up for the exam;
:it should be attended;
:Once the exam is attended, it will be evaluated;
:v3: Is exam passed? ({Yes, No}); <<objectSignal>>
backward:another sign-up for the exam is required;
repeat while () is ([v3 = "No"]) not ([v3 = "Yes"])
:If the exam is passed;
:the course is considered passed;
stop
case ([v2 = "Last_Announce"])
:announcing the date of the exam;
endswitch
@enduml